#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:1
msgid "HM-D20-4G"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:3
msgid "产品定位"
msgstr "Product overview"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:6
msgid ""
"**面向无人机和紧凑型移动平台的轻量化一体化 RTK 接收机。** 设备集成四臂螺旋天"
"线、定位计算单元与 4G 通信链路，通过 CORS/NTRIP 获取差分数据并直接输出定位结"
"果。"
msgstr ""
"**A lightweight, integrated RTK GNSS receiver for UAVs and compact mobile "
"platforms.** It combines a quadrifilar helix antenna (QHA), positioning "
"engine, and 4G correction link, receives correction data through CORS/NTRIP, "
"and outputs positioning data directly."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:9
msgid "HM-D20-4G 四臂螺旋天线一体化 RTK 接收机"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G Integrated RTK GNSS Receiver with Quadrifilar Helix Antenna"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:14
msgid "核心价值"
msgstr "Key benefits"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:16
msgid ""
"**轻量紧凑**：整机 38.2 g，外形 Φ54.5 × 53 mm，降低无人机载荷和安装空间压力。"
msgstr ""
"**Lightweight and compact**: At 38.2 g and Φ54.5 × 53 mm, the unit minimizes "
"payload and installation space on UAVs."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:17
msgid "**差分链路一体化**：通过 4G 接入 CORS/NTRIP，无需在作业区架设本地基站。"
msgstr ""
"**Integrated correction link**: Connects to CORS/NTRIP over 4G, eliminating "
"the need to deploy a local base station."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:18
msgid ""
"**安装位置更灵活**：4G 天线采用外置 SMA 接口，可将天线布置到合适位置，减少与"
"平台其他设备相互影响。"
msgstr ""
"**Flexible installation**: The external SMA 4G antenna can be positioned "
"away from other onboard equipment to reduce interference."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:19
msgid ""
"**面向飞控集成**：8-pin 接口统一提供电源、UART 和磁力计信号，可按订单配置无人"
"机或地面输出固件。"
msgstr ""
"**Designed for flight-controller integration**: The 8-pin connector carries "
"power, UART, and magnetometer signals; UAV or ground firmware can be "
"configured at delivery."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:21
msgid "工作方式"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:23
msgid "![HM-D20-4G通过4G接入CORS](../images/scenarios/d20-4g-ref.png)"
msgstr "![HM-D20-4G Accessing CORS via 4G](../images/scenarios/d20-4g-ref.png)"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:23
msgid "HM-D20-4G通过4G接入CORS"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G accesses CORS through 4G"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:25
msgid ""
"设备接收 GNSS 卫星信号，同时通过 4G 网络获取 CORS/NTRIP 差分数据；完成 RTK 解"
"算后，通过 8-pin 接口向飞控、机器人主控或 PC 输出 NMEA 或 UBX 数据。"
msgstr ""
"The receiver combines GNSS measurements with CORS/NTRIP corrections over 4G, "
"computes the RTK solution, and outputs NMEA or UBX through the 8-pin "
"interface to a flight controller, robot host, or PC."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:27
msgid "交付组成"
msgstr "Package contents"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:29
msgid "HM-D20-4G 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G rover."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:30
msgid ""
"8-pin 连接线缆、外置 4G 天线、USB-C 配置线和兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 "
"UART 转接器。"
msgstr ""
"Includes an 8-pin cable, an external 4G antenna, a USB-C configuration "
"cable, and a USB-to-UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:33
msgid ""
"使用前提 用户需要自行准备**有流量的 Nano-SIM 卡、可用的 CORS/NTRIP 账号和蜂窝"
"网络覆盖**。"
msgstr ""
"Prerequisites Before use, the user needs to prepare **a Nano-SIM card with "
"data, a valid CORS/NTRIP account, and cellular network coverage** on their "
"own."

