msgstr "-40–85 °C / -50–105 °C"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:52
msgid ""
"完整 GNSS 频点、灵敏度、动态条件和 LTE 频段请查看[产品对比与资料](../"
"comparison.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Product Comparison and Resources](../comparison.md) for complete GNSS "
"frequencies, sensitivity, dynamic limits, and LTE bands."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:54
msgid "外部接口"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:61
msgid "HM-D20-4G 底部接口实物图"
msgstr "Photo of the HM-D20-4G bottom interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:61
msgid "HM-D20-4G 底部接口"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G bottom interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:64
msgid ""
"**8-pin GH1.25 mm**：供电、3.3 V UART、3.3 V PPS 和磁力计 SCL/SDA 信号。"
msgstr ""
"**8-pin GH1.25 mm**: Power, 3.3 V UART, 3.3 V PPS, and magnetometer SCL/SDA "
"signals."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:65
msgid "**SMA**：连接外置宽频 4G 天线。"
msgstr "**SMA**: Connect an external wideband 4G antenna."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:66
msgid "**USB-C**：使用标配配置线连接配置工具，写入 CORS/NTRIP 账号信息。"
msgstr ""
"**USB-C**: Use the standard configuration cable to connect the configuration "
"tool and enter the CORS/NTRIP account information."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:69
msgid ""
"8-pin 接线安全 接线前必须查看[完整 8-pin 线束定义](../../rtk/operation/d20-"
"wiring.md)。设备只允许使用 5 V ±0.5 V 供电；正负极反接、使用错误电压或将电源"
"正极接到 TX/RX 等信号线均可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"8-pin wiring safety: Before wiring, check the [complete 8-pin pinout](../../"
"rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md). Power the device only from 5 V ±0.5 V. "
"Reversed polarity, an incorrect supply voltage, or connecting the positive "
"supply lead to TX/RX or another signal pin may damage the device."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:72
msgid "适用场景与前提"
msgstr "Applications and requirements"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-4g.md:74
msgid ""
"适合无人机测绘、低空作业、移动机器人、车载设备和紧凑型定位终端。现场需要蜂窝"
"网络覆盖；SIM 卡流量和 CORS/NTRIP 服务由用户管理。"
msgstr ""
"Suitable for drone surveying and mapping, low-altitude operations, mobile "
"robots, vehicle-mounted equipment, and compact positioning terminals. On-"
"site cellular network coverage is required; SIM card data and CORS/NTRIP "
"services are managed by the user."

